        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0909" n="839" xml:id="pg839"/>

                <head>No. 540.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wallace to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 1, 1883</date>.
                        (Received May 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 211.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose a copy of a
                    communication addressed to the minister of foreign affairs upon the subject of
                    the attack upon the house of Rev. Mr. Cole, of Erzingen, vilayet of Erzroom. You
                    will doubtless observe it is the third one touching that affair.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>LEW. WALLACE.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d539-a1.xml" xpointer="d539-a1"/>
            </div>
